    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Irene Maganga, a dedicated educator, embarked on a transformative journey at Aga Khan University (AKU) in 2023. Her one-year master's degree programme in Language and Literacy Education ignited a passion within her, propelling her to make a significant impact on English language teaching.",
